# Tenant denylist for the leak guard (.githooks/pre-commit).
#
# Copy this file to .githooks/denylist.local (which is git-ignored) and add the
# tenant-specific strings that must NEVER appear in this public repo — one per
# line, case-insensitive, matched as plain substrings. Lines starting with # are
# comments. Keep the REAL list out of git: only this .example is tracked.
#
# Examples of what to add (use YOUR real values in denylist.local, not here):
#   yourcompany
#   acme-corp
#   internal.example.net
#   prod-project-name
